1. `/refusing to allow a GitHub App to create or update workflow/` — the App form (the #1591 case). Note real message continues "workflow `file` without `workflows` permission".
2. `/refusing to allow an OAuth App .* without [`']workflow[`'] scope/` — OAuth form.

