Now — one more consideration: the escalation path forks the ENTIRE chain (clone+merge+push) — push target unchanged (forkPushTokenUrl(forkFull)), env swapped. The merge commit author stays sm-silent-update (same -c user.name). Good — the machine-push guards still classify it as machine work.

