+// ── Workflow-write rejection escalation (gh-1106) ───────────────────────────
+//
+// Live fa PR #1591 (2026-10-19 17:16/17:17Z): the fork silent-update pushed
+// the main merge with the silent token (github.token, github-actions[bot])
